VERSION 120

EDIT UG_GATEWAY_MAIN_MENUBAR

MENU NX_REFINE_MENU

BUTTON NX_REFINE_ANALYZE
LABEL Analyze
MESSAGE Analyze the work part for geometry quality issues.
BITMAP checkgreen
ACTIONS NXRefine.Analyze.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_REMOVE_BLENDS
LABEL Remove Blends
MESSAGE Remove blends at or below the configured radius.
BITMAP edge_blend
ACTIONS NXRefine.RemoveBlends.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_FILL_HOLES
LABEL Fill Holes
MESSAGE Fill cylindrical hole candidates below the configured diameter.
BITMAP hole
ACTIONS NXRefine.FillHoles.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_REMOVE_MARKINGS
LABEL Remove Markings
MESSAGE Find and review connected marking face groups on a selected body.
BITMAP text
ACTIONS NXRefine.RemoveMarkings.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_REPAIR_SHEETS
LABEL Repair Sheets
MESSAGE Sew sheet bodies using the configured tolerance.
BITMAP sew
ACTIONS NXRefine.RepairSheets.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_PATCH_OPENINGS
LABEL Patch Openings
MESSAGE Detect and highlight open sheet boundaries.
BITMAP bounded_plane
ACTIONS NXRefine.PatchOpenings.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_SETTINGS
LABEL Settings
MESSAGE Configure cleanup thresholds and tolerances.
BITMAP preferences
ACTIONS NXRefine.Settings.dll

BUTTON NX_REFINE_ABOUT
LABEL About
MESSAGE Show NX Refine version and safety information.
BITMAP info
ACTIONS NXRefine.About.dll

END_OF_MENU

BEFORE UG_HELP
    CASCADE_BUTTON NX_REFINE_MENU
    LABEL NX Refine
END_OF_BEFORE
